    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I'm tired of seeing these generic essays when I search for stuff. I need to make a decision for the upcoming election and I want a straight answer. Between Candidate Smith and Candidate Miller, who is actually better suited to handle the current inflation crisis? Don't give me the \"on the one hand\" speech; just tell me the reality.",
